OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain sweeps
OL,6,Fin overnight, with heavy accumulations
OL,7,Fin western areas. Wintry flurries and
OL,8,Fsome ice in the north. In the
OL,9,Fnorthwest, coastal gales, severe at
OL,10,Ftimes. To the southeast, cloudy and
OL,11,Fdry. Feeling chilly with patchy
OL,12,Fovernight frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FThe rain and winds ease, with
OL,15,Fa legacy of cloud through much of
OL,16,FGreat Britain. To the west, sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Temperatures recovering in the
OL,18,Fsouth, but overnight frost further
OL,19,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
